rchived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-02-09T20:21:28Z","updated_at":"2026-03-16T16:44:29Z","closed_at":"2026-03-16T16:42:23Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproductible in 4.6\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9174) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-12900K (24 threads) - 63.78 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\n## Intro\nI am not sure if this is a bug or a candidate for a [proposals](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals).\n\n## Summary\nDuring export, when files are ignored they references are still present in the files `.godot/global_script_class_cache.cfg` and `.godot/uid_cache.bin` inside the file `game.pck`\n\n## What I did\nI have set the option to exclude the script:\n\n<img width=\"556\" height=\"287\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ad192506-2f98-4fa4-aa30-fa38b7a811be\" />\n\nAnd fair enought the file is not included in the game.pck file;\n\n<img width=\"892\" height=\"311\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4e7fc791-83cd-4034-9ed8-3ab0e70b7557\" />\n\n## What is the problem\n\nBut inside the files `.godot/global_script_class_cache.cfg` and `.godot/uid_cache.bin` there is still some references to the excluded file.\n\n<img width=\"1318\" height=\"98\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a7dcc0f6-ea5e-4e07-875e-2013888096ec\" />\n\n\n```cfg\nlist=[{\n\"base\": &\"Node\",\n\"class\": &\"Foo\",\n\"icon\": \"\",\n\"is_abstract\": false,\n\"is_tool\": false,\n\"language\": &\"GDScript\",\n\"path\": \"res://excluded_script.gd\"\n}]\n```\n\n## Why it's a problem ?\nFirst there is a useless set of data that could be cleanup.\nThe result of the method [ProjectSettings.get_global_class_list()](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_projectsettings.html#class-projectsettings-method-get-global-class-list) give data for not existing scripts.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCompile the MRP and check the generated game.pck file using your favourite tool for example [GodotPckTool](https://github.com/hhyyrylainen/GodotPckTool).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp_export_2026-02-09_21-21-02.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25192562/mrp_export_2026-02-09_21-21-02.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116110/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116110/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}